<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90870" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρωϊζός</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρῳζός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, dub. sens. in <i><span class="en">
			Call.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			63
		</span></i> P.;= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προχθεσινός, ὑπόγυος</span>,
			<i><span class="en">
			<u>EM</u>
			691.56
		</span></i>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> neut. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρωϊζά</span> as Adv.,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρώην, χθιζά τε καὶ π</span>. yesterday or
				<i>the day before</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.303
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				2.141d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὕτω δὴ π. κατέδραθες</span> so very
				<i>early</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				18.9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρωϊζὸν ὁδεύων</span> dub.
			sens. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epic.Alex.Adesp.</u>
				4.6
			</span></i>. (In codd. freq. written proparox., but cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
			</span></i> Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.144
			</span></i>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
